{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440120/extras/CRUS-Steam_description-headers_About-EN.png?t=1745472477\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the thrilling era of the Crusades and forge your destiny in <i>Knights of the Crusades</i>. Combining real-time strategy, city-building, and sandbox gameplay, this immersive experience lets you rewrite history and lead a knightly order to glory. Will you rise as a beacon of faith, or succumb to the challenges of a war-torn world?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440120/extras/CRUS-steam-gif-05.gif?t=1745472477\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440120/extras/CRUS-Steam_description-headers_Choose-EN.png?t=1745472477\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Begin your adventure as a founding member of the legendary Templars or your custom Holy Order</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel from Western Europe to the Holy Land to take part in the First Crusades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become a founding father of the Holy Order</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440120/extras/CRUS-Steam_description-headers_City-EN.png?t=1745472477\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Capture and develop hamlets with dozens of essential structures </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate complex economy system with survival elements both in RTS and World Map modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Generate resources like silver and piety, which are critical for expanding your influence and sustaining your armies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440120/extras/CRUS-steam-gif-01.gif?t=1745472477\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440120/extras/CRUS-Steam_description-headers_Strategic-EN.png?t=1745472477\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in epic RTS combat against AI armies on land and at sea.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defend your hamlets, siege massive cities, and rewrite history through challenging scripted scenarios.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440120/extras/CRUS-steam-gif-03.gif?t=1745472477\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440120/extras/CRUS-Steam_description-headers_Dynamic-EN.png?t=1745472477\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transition into open-ended gameplay after the main campaign, capturing new territories and building alliances</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience escalating challenges with Muslim, Slavic, and Christian AI factions vying for control of key regions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440120/extras/CRUS-Steam_description-headers_Forge-EN.png?t=1745472477\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead campaigns in the Holy Land, Spain, North Africa, and Eastern Europe. Use strategy and diplomacy to secure alliances or crush your foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Participate in historical events, like the Reconquista or the defense of Edessa, and determine the fate of the Holy Land.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440120/extras/CRUS-steam-gif-04.gif?t=1745472477\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440120/extras/CRUS-Steam_description-headers_A-Living-EN.png?t=1745472477\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a massive map filled with towns, cities, and pilgrim routes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate dynamic events, including naval battles, sieges, and AI faction wars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face challenges such as piety-driven resource systems, excommunication events, and escalating enemy attacks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440120/extras/CRUS-steam-gif-02.gif?t=1745472477\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you rise to the challenge, expand your knightly order, and safeguard the future of Christendom? <i>Knights of the Crusades</i> invites you to embark on a grand journey of strategy, faith, and conquest.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3440120?t=1745472477","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440120/d0ecfabd517ad80b846bfffba1524b8e9d6e3849/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745472477","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440120/022d9e9ab1b0447905f13add38c06b885ef21b4d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745472477","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440120/022d9e9ab1b0447905f13add38c06b885ef21b4d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745472477","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3517490,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://s